        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "The seal-fires wait. <CUSTOM6380> of 3 burn for you — one stands here among the records, two flank Balin's tomb. Light them all, and stand ready for what rises with the third."
          }
        }
      },
      {
