        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*The shade looks through you, mournful* No. The thing beneath the twentieth plot unmade better warriors than you, and I will not write another name in the Book. Return when you are stronger — the wraith is no foe for the untried."
          }
        }
      },
