        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*The shade bows low* The braziers stand cold where we left them: one here among the records, two flanking the tomb of Balin son of Fundin. Touch flame to all three. When the third burns, the thing that broke our watch will come to smother it — destroy it, and return to me."
          }
        }
      }
